## Conventions

- Keep this file under 200 lines. Beyond that, split per-topic into `.claude/rules/<topic>.md` with `paths:` frontmatter so the rule only loads when matching files are read. See `.claude/rules/README.md`.
- Architecture decisions go in `docs/adr/`. Product requirements in `docs/prd/`.
- Keep to stable rules + conventions. Settled decisions → `docs/adr/`; don't track ephemeral state (current focus, in-progress work) here.

